			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3780
			},
			"text": " If the Hubble telescope were aimed at the Earth, how detailed would the images be?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,780",
				"to": "00:00:06,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3780,
				"to": 6600
			},
			"text": " The first small problem we'll run into is resolution."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,600",
				"to": "00:00:10,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6600,
				"to": 10900
			},
			"text": " Hubble is the best visible light telescope we have, but its resolving power does have limits."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,900",
				"to": "00:00:13,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10900,
				"to": 13520
			},
			"text": " Pluto out in the Kuiper Belt lies right at those limits."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:13,520",
				"to": "00:00:17,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 13520,
				"to": 17760
			},
			"text": " Until the New Horizons flyby of Pluto, the best pictures we had of Pluto were from Hubble,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,760",
				"to": "00:00:19,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17760,
				"to": 19100
			},
			"text": " and they were pretty bad."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,100",
				"to": "00:00:22,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19100,
				"to": 22480
			},
			"text": " To Hubble, the X-Planet is little more than a mysterious blur."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:22,480",
				"to": "00:00:24,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 22480,
				"to": 24660
			},
			"text": " But the big problem is motion."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,660",
				"to": "00:00:28,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24660,
				"to": 28320
			},
			"text": " Hubble is moving across Earth's surface at over 7 kilometers per second."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:28,320",
				"to": "00:00:32,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 28320,
				"to": 32480
			},
			"text": " Any reasonable length exposure, even with perfect resolution, would be completely blurred"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:32,480",
				"to": "00:00:33,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 32480,
				"to": 33480
			},
			"text": " in the direction of motion."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,480",
				"to": "00:00:36,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33480,
				"to": 36480
			},
			"text": " It's the same problem as driving along a highway and trying to take a picture of the"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:36,480",
				"to": "00:00:38,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 36480,
				"to": 38620
			},
			"text": " ground passing beneath your car."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:38,620",
				"to": "00:00:42,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 38620,
				"to": 42400
			},
			"text": " Combining the two effects of resolution and motion gives us an end result that looks like"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,400",
				"to": "00:00:43,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42400,
				"to": 43400
			},
			"text": " this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:43,400",
				"to": "00:00:44,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 43400,
				"to": 44160
			},
			"text": " That's no good."
		}
